# cards: Steal (docs/plan-cards.md 5). Jian (level 1) wears the Morus card (260, his slot 0x020B46A2); first temple
# battle, the enemies' HP pinned. His Special list holds Steal (shot sl_list: "Steal", 0); A opens the enemy grid,
# A steals from the highlighted enemy. The random state is set to 24 (roll 3, under 50) at the steal's first roll
# (cave_skill_steal + 0x48: the address moves with the cave). Expect: Jian's MP unchanged, the battle flags
# (0x02282940) gain the robbed bit of that enemy (0x10000 << (battler - 4)), the stolen item id in cave_skill_stolen
# (0x01FFBB64 in this build), the message line "Stole <item>!" (shots sl_msg_*). Round 2: every enemy is marked
# robbed (the flags poked to 0x007F0000), so the pick is refused ("No effect!", shot sl_refused). Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba33 1
poke u16 0x020b46a2 260
execpoke 0x01FFBC68 u32 0x020A0238 24
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u32 0x02282940 flags
watch u16 0x01FFBB64 stolen
watch u32 0x0228e878 jian_mp
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot sl_list
press A 8
wait 60
shot sl_grid
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 3000
wait 20
shot sl_msg_0
wait 20
shot sl_msg_1
wait 20
shot sl_msg_2
wait 20
shot sl_msg_3
wait 20
shot sl_msg_4
wait 20
shot sl_msg_5
wait 20
shot sl_msg_6
wait 20
shot sl_msg_7
wait 20
shot sl_msg_8
wait 20
shot sl_msg_9
wait 20
shot sl_msg_10
wait 20
shot sl_msg_11
wait 20
shot sl_msg_12
wait 20
shot sl_msg_13
wait 20
shot sl_msg_14
wait 20
shot sl_msg_15
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
poke u32 0x02282940 0x007F0000
shot sl_r2_menu
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot sl_r2_list
press A 8
wait 60
shot sl_r2_grid
press A 8
wait 30
shot sl_refused
